sequenceDiagram
    participant Q as Queue / worker
    participant C as Consumer (your app)
    participant P as Provider (e.g. Stripe)

    C->>P: 1. Register webhook URL (+ shared secret)
    Note over P: event occurs (payment.succeeded)
    P->>C: 2. POST /webhook — payload + X-Signature (HMAC)
    C->>C: 3. Verify HMAC signature — OK
    C-->>P: 4. 200 OK (ack fast)
    C->>Q: 5. Enqueue for async processing
    Q->>Q: 6. Process (idempotent — dedupe by event id)
